This directory (packages/investing/src/predictos) contains source code that is
adapted from the PredictOS project:

    https://github.com/PredictionXBT/PredictOS

The original code was released by PredictionXBT under the MIT License. The
adaptation ports the reusable backend TypeScript from Deno / Supabase edge
functions to Node/ESM for the `investing` npm package. Prompt text, request
shapes, parsing, and error handling are preserved; the HTTP/CORS wrappers and
Deno-specific APIs were removed or replaced. No API keys or secret values from
the upstream repository were copied.

